OL,3,GNEWSAPontins put profits over safety   
OL,4,Abefore woman's death, court told       
OL,6,FA Pontins holiday park resort put      
OL,7,Fprofits over safety when a grandmother 
OL,8,Fdied after an air conditioning duct    
OL,9,Fcollapsed onto her, day one of a       
OL,10,Fsentencing hearing has been told.      
OL,12,FGrandmother Wendy Jones, 68, of        
OL,13,FHereford, died after spending six      
OL,14,Fmonths in hospital following the       
OL,15,Fincident at Pontins' Brean Sands       
OL,16,Fresort, in Somerset, in February 2019. 
