OL,3,GNEWSAPontins put profits over safety   
OL,4,Abefore woman's death, court told       
OL,6,FPontins' parent firm, Britannia Jinky  
OL,7,FJersey, and a contractor, Stephen      
OL,8,FBennison, are appearing at Bristol     
OL,9,FCrown Court on the first day of their  
OL,10,Fsentencing hearing, after a 40m (131ft)
OL,11,Fsection of air conditioning duct and   
OL,12,Fceiling parts collapsed onto guests,   
OL,13,Finjuring 16 people.                    
OL,15,FThey both admitted failure to discharge
OL,16,Fa duty under health and safety laws.   
